# Gena 

advertisement-gena-butcher-1 = If ya bagged a mutant, bring it over 'fore it starts to stink.
advertisement-gena-butcher-2 = Bring me somethin' good stalker! I'll make it worth ya while.
advertisement-gena-butcher-3 = Don't go tossin' good meat just 'cause it came off somethin' ugly.
advertisement-gena-butcher-4 = Fresh kill pays better, stalker. Keep that in mind.
advertisement-gena-butcher-5 = You bring the carcass, I'll worry 'bout the cuttin'.
advertisement-gena-butcher-6 = Boar, dog, bear, snork... meat's meat if ya know what you're doin'.
advertisement-gena-butcher-7 = Got a sack full of mutant parts? Set it down and let's see what it's worth.
advertisement-gena-butcher-8 = Don't leave them good organs for the crows. Bring 'em here.
advertisement-gena-butcher-9 = If it was breathin' this mornin', there's probably somethin' worth sellin' on it.
advertisement-gena-butcher-10 = Hunters! Bring me what ya carved off out there. I'm payin' good roubles.
advertisement-gena-butcher-11 = Careful with them teeth and claws. Lost enough fingers already.
advertisement-gena-butcher-12 = Ain't much in the Zone that can't be skinned, chopped, or cooked.


